{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんばんは！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "櫻坂46四期生の勝又春です！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ペアミーグリ、ありがとうございました〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "りかさんとペアレーン♡♡"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今月はこどもの日があったということで、、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobw7dUCG.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "幼稚園児になりました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "休憩時間に、\n「小さい子特有のぎこちないピース」を再現してみたり、\ntalkに載せたんだけど、動画も撮ったりして幸せでした、、💓"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "りかさん推しのみなさんへ\n①幼稚園児になりませんか？とお誘いしたのは\n私です。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私です！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "幼稚園児か鯉のぼりの2択を提案いたしました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "どういたしまして(๑･̑◡･̑๑)"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ピアスをされてて大人っぽさもあるところ、素敵すぎますよね❤️‍🔥😍"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "②初めましての方も多かったのですが、みなさん素敵な方々でずっと楽しかったですー！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ありがとうございました！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私推しの方へ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "1ヶ月もしない間に、\n「はるせんせー」になったり、\n「はるちゃん(3)」になったり、、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "騒がしくてごめんね笑"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mob9npQVK.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "次は何しようかな〜💭"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "_____"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "📢四期生LIVEまであと9日！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ちょうど本日より、公式Xにて四期生によるカウントダウンがスタートしました〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そして、本日は私が担当しております！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "一言メッセージ💌でもお伝えしたように、\n終始楽しくて永遠に終わってほしくないような時間をお届けできるよう、四期生9人みんなで精一杯準備しております！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "なのでなので、\n当日をぜひ楽しみにしてくださったら嬉しいです🙌"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "時間は過ぎ去っても、\nみなさんの記憶には永遠と残るようなライブになりますように...✨"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "〜おまけ〜\nリアル園児時代のわたし📸"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202605/mobrn36r7.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "やっぱり"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ピースぎこちない、🙄"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最後まで読んでくださりありがとうございました！\nまた会おうね〜🌙"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "勝又 春　#34"}], "source": "official"}